{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A painting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\" X <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\" is to be placed into a wooden frame with the longer dimension vertical. The wood at the top and bottom is twice as wide as the wood on the sides. If the frame area equals that of the painting itself, the ratio of the smaller to the larger dimension of the framed painting is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a82733b92f8b7391a6b17119f1acb4f5ea41ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 1:3\\quad \\text{(B) } 1:2\\quad \\text{(C) } 2:3\\quad \\text{(D) } 3:4\\quad \\text{(E) } 1:1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"384\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the width of the frame on the sides to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Then, the width of the frame on the top and bottom is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>The area of the frame is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281e0a93c1bd6fec652a59dc7fdbfd9813de42e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\cdot 2x-18\\cdot24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Setting the area of the frame equal to the area of the picture,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/c/05c72b7e113df5e72e4fe3b9a9d58019f72c1a08.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2x+18)(4x+24)-18\\cdot24 = 18\\cdot24\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"18\" />\nSolving,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/2/ec2c12f7deaef6bfff85dac64e663c1c985dbea6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8x^2+120x+432 = 864\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be2d51b6b99feada4d5ba2492015d3178b2a4f6a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+15x-54=0\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af6bce53c411a7dc33267c587ea3c669a27625d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+18)(x-3)=0\\Rightarrow x=3\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the ratio of the smaller side to the larger side is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a97fda0ddb945b339e50ca31a4e4b9ff3a26cbfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18+2\\cdot3}{24+4\\cdot3}=\\frac{24}{36}=\\boxed{2:3 (C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>~AOPS81619\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php